    <li>Sablik, Tim, "Cyberattacks and the Digital Dilemma," Econ Focus, Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond, Third Quarter 2017. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" class="offsite" target="_blank" href="https://www.richmondfed.org/-/media/richmondfedorg/publications/research/econ_focus/2017/q3/ cover_story.pdf">https://www.richmondfed.org/-/media/richmondfedorg/publications/research/econ_focus/2017/q3/ cover_story.pdf</a>)</li>
